Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a mission\Nto complete. Mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How quickly we'll forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the term Millennium\NItem sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you promise to help\Nme obtain all seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the moment we only have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where the others are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need someone to take me to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's where you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.55,0:01:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the vessel that\Nallows me to exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stop resisting and join me. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I'm\Ngiving you the choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And the most powerful force\Nthat ever existed will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't force me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.93,0:01:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkest shadow game in\Nfive millennia will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,New Year Rah - New Year Rah -
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to reduce the summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, Valley of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is interested in your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our guest is anxious to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Dr. Motto?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Anxious was an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on the brink of the\Ngreatest discovery of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 60 ancient tombs have\Nbeen discovered in that valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Pharaoh's tomb\Nthat you seek, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,let's just say no one's ever dared\Nto enter its inner chambers, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one, but he was driven\Nmad and now wanders our village,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,repeating the same phrase over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Game. Beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Game, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only fair to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This tomb is loaded with traps,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,built by the ancients to protect\Nthe great treasure within.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're just guides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only lead you as far\Nas the entrance to the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get inside, it\Nis you who must lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it is your expertise that\Nwill lead you to the riches you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not riches I came here to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm after something\Nmuch greater than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's late, and I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What better time to enter a tomb\Nthan the stroke of midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I do have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in search of the\Ntomb, but you seek no treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in becoming rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean I'm not\Nlooking for a hidden treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I like to play games,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I believe that tomb out there contains
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the secret of the greatest\Ngame ever played. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto, I don't know what lies in that\Ncavern, but I'm sure it's no game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I were you, I'd start taking\Nthis expedition a bit more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are not careful, you just\Nmight end up in a tomb of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, at the stroke of\Nmidnight, our journey began.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A journey into a world that\Nwould change my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The tomb of the nameless pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,what's this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but I thought no one\Never entered this tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,no one in the last 5,000 years anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahmed, have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I bet you've never seen any snake\Neyes like those in any of your games, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're rich! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. Hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Jews belong to us, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems like the\Ngame has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This pathway leads nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He passes up priceless rupees to\Nstare into an empty picture frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.31,0:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no treasure here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond here lies the resting place of the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,great pharaoh only those\Nwho show respect may
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,enter all others will\Nbe engulfed by the pit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,of shadows and you\Nexpect us to believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all I know is this spot is\Nthe entrance to the pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see any entrance, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like an entrance to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys, meet Horus, Egyptian god of light\Nand gatekeeper of the pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some sort of maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not a terribly difficult one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Any child could solve this puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These fellas seem to have failed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We found our pit of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who'd like to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I vote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.31,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you seem to be the expert here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing my luck, I'll end\Nup in the pit of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up. We stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far to turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He will clear the maze, and then\Nyou and I will claim the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me. If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse than that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, the nameless pharaoh\Nwanted us to enter that maze
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was time to play the pharaoh's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more to this\Nmaze than meets the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be some way to stop\Nthese things. Well then, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I was playing a game, and\Ntherefore there had to be a solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop those statues or\Nwe'll never make it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped when my foot moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it occurred to me, in ancient Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaohs were respected and revered as\Nmuch as the Egyptian gods themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why every statue in the pharaoh's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,palace was carved with\Nthe left foot forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This was considered a symbol of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the heart is on\Nthe left side of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So ancient Egyptians always faced\Ntheir hearts towards the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the answer to the riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk with your left foot forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the sign said,\Nwe must pay our respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Our left foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And if your theory\Ndoesn't work, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little further. Careful now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but those are the\Nrules of the Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You will pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest taking my advice if you\Nwant to make it out of this tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we here? You\Nshall now be judged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,by the creatures of the stone only the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,pure of heart are permitted to pass all\Nothers will lose their souls to the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,why should i believe all this ancient\Ngibberish what choice do you have
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the Pharaoh's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on these traps, I'm\Nsure it's valuable Go on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt a strange sensation It was as if\Nthere was another presence in the room
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and get it. One mustn't be too hasty.\NWe're dealing with a powerful force here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I knew my guide was\Nblinded by his own greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I didn't know was just\Nhow far he was willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing all the work, Dr. Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can take it from here. You snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, I\Nhave a prize to claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never want for anything again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All this talk of creatures\Nand shadow games is nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When I regained consciousness,\Nsomething felt different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if the darkness\Nhad somehow lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That artifact seemed to\Nbe calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always keep this safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I always did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the Millennium Puzzle\Nis yours. Wow, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have exaggerated just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,does this sudden interest\Nin my old adventures
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,have anything to do with tomorrow's trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I head off to Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to learn everything there\Nis to know about that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They may have moved that stone\Ntablet back to where it came from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not going to stop me\Nfrom seeing it And this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,when I hold up the three\NEgyptian god cards The
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh's lost memories\Nare going to be released
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps, I don't suppose you still remember\Nwhere the pharaoh's tomb was, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hired those two guides to\Nfind it for me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Valley of the Kings\Nis bigger than you think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and most of those caves look\Nexactly the same. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I was\Nlooking forward to seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the spot where you found\Nthe Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,may I have one last look at\Nthose Egyptian god cards? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like your fifth time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thought of being without\Nthem for so long, it makes me so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I love thee? Let me count the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,ways that's enough can't you just leave
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Them with me. Please be a pal. I'll take\Ncare of them. You can trust me, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you know better than that fitter sticks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the Pharaoh needs these three cards
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,without them he'll never be able to\Nunlock all the mysteries of his past
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what the Pharaoh's been\Nwaiting for. It's why he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,when the Pharaoh's spirit was sealed\Naway in that tomb His memory was
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,wiped clean So he waited for 5,000\Nyears Until fate brought him to Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're the one person with the\Npower to help him regain everything he lost
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, he who holds the Millennium\NPuzzle holds the legacy of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe me, that's no\Nsmall task. I know. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My adventure's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,However, yours has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, there's something else I\Nwant you to keep in mind out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, treat every challenge\Nyou face like a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust your instincts and\Nyou'll come out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, playing games is what I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a boy after my own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a big day ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Night, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right,\NYuki? I'm just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,about what grandpa said\Nyou know about fate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing the two of us\Ntogether he said i was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the only one who could\Nhelp you that's true
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since we met it seems like you've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,helped me much more than\Ni've helped you i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it. Before you\Ncame into my life, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.13,0:17:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,spent all my time alone\Ni barely spoke to anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but the minute i put the millennium\Npuzzle together my entire life changed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you gave me the confidence\Ni needed to be myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and to make new friends friends that\Ni'll have for the rest of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's not all i wouldn't be the\Nduelist i am without you face it teaming up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,with you is the best thing that's ever\Nhappened to me in my whole life thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,no thank you i don't know where i'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,without you i just hope i can return the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,favor but you already have i was alone for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly 5,000 years until the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your friends\Nbecame my friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're about to do something\Nfor me that I could never do on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Regain my memory and unlock\Nthe mysteries of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We make an excellent team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian god cards will finally be in\Nthe hands of someone who deserves them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you do admit those\Ncards belong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Go! He's awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If that bag falls into the wrong hands,\Nthe whole world could be in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a joke. I gotta\Nhave a look at these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec. Those\Naren't Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,who's there it hasn't\Nbeen that long has it i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,know you you used to tag\Nalong with yugi right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,listen pal you better not\Nbe after those god cards
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,i already have what i'm\Nafter thanks to you fools
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And what did you do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
